WEBVTT

00:26:27.538 --> 00:26:31.288
I mean, like just born that way, you know,
I was obviously born patient,

00:26:31.288 --> 00:26:36.663
wasn't I? And I could sit for
hours until I got used to me.

00:26:36.663 --> 00:26:41.746
And then I could watch laying eggs and
watch the parents feed the babies

00:26:41.746 --> 00:26:44.996
and watch the babies fly away. And
that took hours of just sitting.

00:26:46.163 --> 00:26:51.371
I think that to be a good mother, which is
a woman's role throughout evolution,

00:26:51.371 --> 00:26:55.121
really going way back, you
have to be patient.

00:26:55.121 --> 00:26:58.288
You can't be a good mother if you're
not patient. I don't think.

00:26:59.621 --> 00:27:03.163
This is quality, we've been talking
about being patient and obstinate